icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.6.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/132.0.6834.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"bb9985ea4ffbeb8cedbd8d9edc3931ab6cb01afd62e47f32439acb3d7fe1676e"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/132.0.6834.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"96d0896a13d94e7cae5618db9c37bca9a4c9f9a0683f37c3df744049db8ce16e"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/132.0.6834.110/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"2f9779ebec5d7e845fc7b82ea4294cd5dbcac3f539ba361d17c5e0af23caa34d"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"132.0.6834.110"}